FUNDAMENTALS
  first commercial Apple computer
  designed and hand-built by Steve Wozniak
  ~200 boards produced, ~50 assembled for Byte Shop
  original retail price $666.66
  fewer than 75 verified survivors
  even fewer still working
  original owner Fred Hatfield declined Jobs trade-in for Apple II
  last auctioned 2013 for ~$671,400
  lot includes board, cassette interface, keyboard, monitor, manuals
